### 2) Brazo: trayectoria por tópico
$ ros2 topic pub --once /scaled_joint_trajectory_controller/joint_trajectory trajectory_msgs/msg/JointTrajectory "{joint_names: ['shoulder_pan_joint','shoulder_lift_joint','elbow_joint','wrist_1_joint','wrist_2_joint','wrist_3_joint'], points: [{positions: [0.8, -1.2, 1.4, -1.77, -1.57, 0.0], time_from_start: {sec: 3}}]}"
